{"912960":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Gate Fall","steam_appid":912960,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/6661dee591f82eb118ba683c62e7969e.poster.avif?t=1793693945\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/6661dee591f82eb118ba683c62e7969e.webm?t=1793693945\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/6661dee591f82eb118ba683c62e7969e.mp4?t=1793693945\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You fall. You wake up in front of a stone Gate under a violet sky. Nobody knows where you came from… except perhaps the Echo whispering inside the portal.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gate Fall is a 2D pixel-art adventure about exploration and mining, with a real story, living towns, automation… and boss fights that break every rule.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/b676be9094e2ced2982a3448e48af96f.avif?t=1793693945\" width=1170 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Carve the world with your laser, block by block: crystal caves, mushroom forests, a cursed forest, the abyss.<br><\/li><li>Fly anywhere with your jetpack and find ores hidden in the rock, ruins and camps.<br><\/li><li>Enter <strong>parallel dimensions<\/strong> through black holes… before the timer runs out, and beware of your evil twin.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/b037fb1a9b081ea08fe2e536be19fd0b.avif?t=1793693945\" width=1170 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build your base, platforms, elevators and modules.<br><\/li><li>Run an <strong>automated factory<\/strong> with conveyor belts, transport drones and storage… to fill the Gate.<br><\/li><li>Your buildings stand… or collapse if nothing holds them up.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/665177a9cbe4988f61211cc9119edf43.avif?t=1793693945\" width=1170 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Living towns: Halte-Étoile, Sporeval, the underground town of Halte-Profonde and its miners, Vitréa the crystal city.<br><\/li><li>Townsfolk, quests, contracts, a wandering trader, animals… and your own house, with its arcade cabinets.<br><\/li><li>Grow your character in a <strong>sky of constellations<\/strong>: 6 skill trees, 47 stars to unlock.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op for up to 4 players:<\/strong> invite up to 3 Steam friends into your world. Dig, build and fight together, each with your own bag. The more of you there are, the tougher the creatures.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/094a70644448175340632b1c5d0666ef.avif?t=1793693945\" width=1170 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss is a game of its own:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The Silence, Devourer of Song<\/strong>: a duel in a 3D arena.<br><\/li><li><strong>The Scribbler<\/strong>: a fight drawn entirely in pencil, where even you become a sketch.<br><\/li><li><strong>Seraphin, the Devouring Archangel<\/strong>: a first-person fight above the clouds, wings spread, magic staff in hand.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/1627b233799b96e6ed3b59b90157b7b2.avif?t=1793693945\" width=1170 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The Original Lands<\/strong>: where it all begins.<br><\/li><li><strong>The Crystal Lands<\/strong>: a new world, a grey dream, and the city of Vitréa.<br><\/li><li><strong>Paradise<\/strong>: floating islands, angel wings instead of a jetpack… and angels who are not what they seem.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Keyboard\/mouse or controller. The game is currently in French only.<\/i><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/6661dee591f82eb118ba683c62e7969e.poster.avif?t=1793693945\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/6661dee591f82eb118ba683c62e7969e.webm?t=1793693945\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/6661dee591f82eb118ba683c62e7969e.mp4?t=1793693945\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You fall. You wake up in front of a stone Gate under a violet sky. Nobody knows where you came from… except perhaps the Echo whispering inside the portal.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gate Fall is a 2D pixel-art adventure about exploration and mining, with a real story, living towns, automation… and boss fights that break every rule.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/b676be9094e2ced2982a3448e48af96f.avif?t=1793693945\" width=1170 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Carve the world with your laser, block by block: crystal caves, mushroom forests, a cursed forest, the abyss.<br><\/li><li>Fly anywhere with your jetpack and find ores hidden in the rock, ruins and camps.<br><\/li><li>Enter <strong>parallel dimensions<\/strong> through black holes… before the timer runs out, and beware of your evil twin.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/b037fb1a9b081ea08fe2e536be19fd0b.avif?t=1793693945\" width=1170 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build your base, platforms, elevators and modules.<br><\/li><li>Run an <strong>automated factory<\/strong> with conveyor belts, transport drones and storage… to fill the Gate.<br><\/li><li>Your buildings stand… or collapse if nothing holds them up.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/665177a9cbe4988f61211cc9119edf43.avif?t=1793693945\" width=1170 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Living towns: Halte-Étoile, Sporeval, the underground town of Halte-Profonde and its miners, Vitréa the crystal city.<br><\/li><li>Townsfolk, quests, contracts, a wandering trader, animals… and your own house, with its arcade cabinets.<br><\/li><li>Grow your character in a <strong>sky of constellations<\/strong>: 6 skill trees, 47 stars to unlock.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op for up to 4 players:<\/strong> invite up to 3 Steam friends into your world. Dig, build and fight together, each with your own bag. The more of you there are, the tougher the creatures.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/094a70644448175340632b1c5d0666ef.avif?t=1793693945\" width=1170 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss is a game of its own:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The Silence, Devourer of Song<\/strong>: a duel in a 3D arena.<br><\/li><li><strong>The Scribbler<\/strong>: a fight drawn entirely in pencil, where even you become a sketch.<br><\/li><li><strong>Seraphin, the Devouring Archangel<\/strong>: a first-person fight above the clouds, wings spread, magic staff in hand.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/extras\/1627b233799b96e6ed3b59b90157b7b2.avif?t=1793693945\" width=1170 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>The Original Lands<\/strong>: where it all begins.<br><\/li><li><strong>The Crystal Lands<\/strong>: a new world, a grey dream, and the city of Vitréa.<br><\/li><li><strong>Paradise<\/strong>: floating islands, angel wings instead of a jetpack… and angels who are not what they seem.<\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Keyboard\/mouse or controller. The game is currently in French only.<\/i><\/p>","short_description":"An astronaut falls through an ancient Gate onto an unknown world. Dig with your laser, fly with your jetpack, build a factory, help living towns… then cross the Gate: crystal lands, a floating Paradise, and three epic bosses in 2D, 3D and first person.","supported_languages":"French, English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/bc129b83c3dadddee42cf56b787785cc59c3ff4f\/header.jpg?t=1793693945","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/ebe7a8300e962220ce9d892e4cb529ba23a95dce\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793693945","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/ebe7a8300e962220ce9d892e4cb529ba23a95dce\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793693945","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 \/ AMD FX-6300<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Vulkan 1.2 compatible GPU, 2 GB VRAM (GeForce GTX 750 Ti \/ Radeon RX 460)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> The 3D boss fights need a Vulkan-capable graphics card with up-to-date drivers.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GeForce GTX 1060 \/ Radeon RX 580 (4 GB VRAM)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Sturaka"],"publishers":["Sturaka"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":999,"final":999,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$9.99"},"packages":[292894],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Gate Fall","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":292894,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Gate Fall - $9.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":999}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":9,"description":"Co-op"},{"id":38,"description":"Online Co-op"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Action"},{"id":"25","description":"Adventure"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"70","description":"Early Access"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/0f06711110ec33478cc153cea0a96c23ec50a6f8\/ss_0f06711110ec33478cc153cea0a96c23ec50a6f8.600x338.jpg?t=1793693945","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/0f06711110ec33478cc153cea0a96c23ec50a6f8\/ss_0f06711110ec33478cc153cea0a96c23ec50a6f8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793693945"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/5340313ee969fcca53cd373d7431a34149a25a7d\/ss_5340313ee969fcca53cd373d7431a34149a25a7d.600x338.jpg?t=1793693945","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/5340313ee969fcca53cd373d7431a34149a25a7d\/ss_5340313ee969fcca53cd373d7431a34149a25a7d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793693945"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/89c6d5124677a7b5df824eb2d3554c5a55df7263\/ss_89c6d5124677a7b5df824eb2d3554c5a55df7263.600x338.jpg?t=1793693945","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/89c6d5124677a7b5df824eb2d3554c5a55df7263\/ss_89c6d5124677a7b5df824eb2d3554c5a55df7263.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793693945"},{"id":3,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/beeaca8df3c0bb97d2309113138d4717af6f6233\/ss_beeaca8df3c0bb97d2309113138d4717af6f6233.600x338.jpg?t=1793693945","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/beeaca8df3c0bb97d2309113138d4717af6f6233\/ss_beeaca8df3c0bb97d2309113138d4717af6f6233.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793693945"},{"id":4,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/e382aeb6748012d0811feb523fff5ad98fcb9953\/ss_e382aeb6748012d0811feb523fff5ad98fcb9953.600x338.jpg?t=1793693945","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/e382aeb6748012d0811feb523fff5ad98fcb9953\/ss_e382aeb6748012d0811feb523fff5ad98fcb9953.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793693945"},{"id":5,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/24ba6033e9a1f25eea7213110ce23e43d2f1a7c0\/ss_24ba6033e9a1f25eea7213110ce23e43d2f1a7c0.600x338.jpg?t=1793693945","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/24ba6033e9a1f25eea7213110ce23e43d2f1a7c0\/ss_24ba6033e9a1f25eea7213110ce23e43d2f1a7c0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793693945"},{"id":6,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/7e59c0c061453d5c0cfd413bded6311c80eef0cb\/ss_7e59c0c061453d5c0cfd413bded6311c80eef0cb.600x338.jpg?t=1793693945","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/7e59c0c061453d5c0cfd413bded6311c80eef0cb\/ss_7e59c0c061453d5c0cfd413bded6311c80eef0cb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793693945"},{"id":7,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/4a1a372251fca198af14489edde9d53933525ca3\/ss_4a1a372251fca198af14489edde9d53933525ca3.600x338.jpg?t=1793693945","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/4a1a372251fca198af14489edde9d53933525ca3\/ss_4a1a372251fca198af14489edde9d53933525ca3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793693945"},{"id":8,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/d945fa2bdc8aff8ee0d4a8cefde7f426e19da6a3\/ss_d945fa2bdc8aff8ee0d4a8cefde7f426e19da6a3.600x338.jpg?t=1793693945","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/912960\/d945fa2bdc8aff8ee0d4a8cefde7f426e19da6a3\/ss_d945fa2bdc8aff8ee0d4a8cefde7f426